# Harness warmup (strategy-codex)

New Cursor threads have **no memory** of prior operator state. Warmup fixes that.

**Record frozen:** Grace-Mar fork growth is not a system objective. Default user is **`strategy-codex`**. See [`docs/grace-mar-instance-boundary.md`](../../docs/grace-mar-instance-boundary.md). Use `--territory companion` only on explicit fork revive.

## When to run

At the **start of a new chat** when work touches **operator state** (integrity, ship, statecraft archive, OpenClaw handoff, bootstrap continuation):

1. Run from repo root:
   ```bash
   python3 scripts/harness_warmup.py -u strategy-codex
   ```
   Use `--compact` if the operator prefers one paragraph. **`--territory work-politics`** (aliases: `pol`, `wp`) = work-politics pending only; **`--territory companion`** = Record/gate pending only (fork revive).

2. **Include the command output** in your reply (paste verbatim or as a fenced markdown block) so the thread carries the same snapshot.

**Optional one-line snapshot:** `python3 scripts/harness_warmup.py -u strategy-codex --receipt` (combine with `--territory` as needed). **Do not** require this as the first line of every reply.

**One-command re-entry paste:** `python3 scripts/operator_reentry_stack.py -u strategy-codex` runs handoff check, then `operator_daily_warmup` (`coffee` Step 1), then harness (add `--compact` for a shorter harness tail).

**`coffee`:** Follow `.cursor/skills/coffee/SKILL.md` — Step 2 **A–D** hub (Confirm / Test / Deepen / Reframe). **Conductor** is standalone only.

**`dream` (end-of-day maintenance):** Follow `.cursor/skills/dream/SKILL.md`. **End-of-day bundle:** `python3 scripts/operator_end_of_day.py -u strategy-codex` runs dream + handoff-check in one pass.

## When you may skip

- Operator says they're only editing unrelated code/docs with no operator/integrity context.
- Warmup was already pasted in this thread.
- Trivial one-line fix with no pipeline involvement.

## Relation to bootstrap

`bootstrap/grace-mar-bootstrap.md` = legacy procedure. Prefer [`docs/start-here.md`](../../docs/start-here.md). Warmup = **current state** (integrity, ship, interpretive-machine health). Policy lives in `AGENTS.md` and [`docs/grace-mar-instance-boundary.md`](../../docs/grace-mar-instance-boundary.md).

## Do not

- Merge or stage from warmup output — it's read-only context.
- Default to gate review, elicit-knowledge, or capture-gap nudges when Record is frozen.
- Treat warmup text as Record truth.
